{"id":"lp60i49mgoedxlwj5u4dqemsm","title":"frag-mich-was 项目：无后端的纯前端语义检索应用","originalTitle":"一个纯前端的语义检索的项目","summary":"这是一个名为 frag-mich-was 的项目，由巴塞尔城市史基金会开发，用于自家出版物的语义检索。该项目完全依赖前端技术，使用 Pyodide 编译成 WebAssembly，并通过 GitHub Pages 静态托管。它提供了三种检索模式，分别是向量余弦相似度、关键词匹配和融合排名，但中文效果不佳，主要因分词和跨语言映射问题。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3528294&do=blog&id=1561749"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T11:41:35.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T00:24:12.878Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T00:24:12.878Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表"],"score":30,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"48bd8a9d-4488-4e0d-979b-78eb4dcf4e1f","title":"巴塞尔史基金会推出纯前端语义检索项目存在中文分词缺陷"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"48bd8a9d-4488-4e0d-979b-78eb4dcf4e1f","title":"巴塞尔史基金会推出纯前端语义检索项目存在中文分词缺陷"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fNLAXYAnR2G8","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}